# This repo ships one page: index.html, plus README and LICENSE.
# Anything else in the working directory is local noise and must not be
# published by a stray `git add .`.
#
# Note: `#` only opens a comment at the START of a line. A trailing comment
# is part of the pattern, so these stay on their own lines.

